# Cline Rules — Freerouting C++ Migration

## Project
Freerouting Java → C++20 PCB autorouter. Java source is truth. Headless routing parity.

## Read at Start
- `SOURCE_OF_TRUTH/README.md`
- `SOURCE_OF_TRUTH/01_MEMORY.md`
- `SOURCE_OF_TRUTH/05_WORK_PACKAGES.md`

## Build & Test
```bash
cmake --build build --target <module> -j$(nproc)
ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure
```

## Rules
- Java `java/app/freerouting/**` = source of truth
- 3 files per class: `.h`, `.cpp`, `_test.cpp`
- C++20 only: smart pointers, RAII, `std::optional`
- PascalCase classes, snake_case functions, trailing `_` private
- `freerouting_core` = leaf lib (no deps)
- Never include `src/board/Components.h/.cpp` (dead code)
- Java nets are 1-based

## After Changes
Update `SOURCE_OF_TRUTH/02_PROGRESS.md` and `docs/migration/INDEX.md`.
